<title>USA: CBOE says to list Big B options.</title>
<headline>CBOE says to list Big B options.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange (CBOE) said on Wednesday it would list options on shares of Big B Inc on September 16.</p>
<p>The CBOE said Big B options would trade on the March cycle, with initial expiration months of October, November, December and March.</p>
<p>It said opening strike prices would be 12-1/2, 15 and 17-1/2 and that the options would trade in the United Technologies Corp trading crowd.</p>
<p>--Chicago derivatives desk, (312) 408-8750</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
